## What Are OT VAPT Services?

Operational Technology Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (OT VAPT) is a cybersecurity process designed to identify and assess vulnerabilities in industrial control systems, Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA) systems, Programmable Logic Controllers (PLCs), and industrial networks.

Vulnerability assessments identify potential security weaknesses, while authorized penetration testing evaluates whether those weaknesses can be exploited. Testing must be carefully planned to protect system availability and avoid disrupting critical operations.

