## Key Features of OT VAPT Services

Professional OT VAPT assessments may include industrial network discovery, SCADA security reviews, PLC security assessments, vulnerability analysis, access control evaluations, and network segmentation reviews.

Because OT environments have strict safety and availability requirements, assessments should follow an agreed scope and consider the potential impact of testing. Passive assessment techniques may be appropriate for sensitive systems where active testing could disrupt operations.

After the assessment, organizations receive a detailed report outlining identified vulnerabilities, risk levels, potential business impacts, and recommended remediation measures. Follow-up testing can help verify that security improvements have been implemented.

